      "post_subject": "SSY-1 legal issues",
      "content_md": "Hi.\n\nTell me please what are the legal issues about sending SSY-1 pulsed lasers from USA to Europe ?\n\nIs there any export licence needed ? Or any other papers ?\n\nDoes it matter it's surplus or that it's a laser ?\n\nI thought about asking to send it as \"holographic equipment\", \"mechanical, optical and electric parts\" or \"electronic parts\" - which all the statements are equally true.\n\nIn one package or split into few packs.\n\nWhat do you think ?\n\nPlease advice.\n\ngreetings\n\nAdam",
      "signature": "",
      "attachments": [],
      "quotes": [],
      "is_first_post": true,
      "url": "https://holographyforum.org/forum/viewtopic.php?p=48545#p48545"
