      "post_date": "Sat May 19, 2007 7:02 pm",
      "post_datetime": "2007-05-20T00:02:00+00:00",
      "post_subject": "SSY-1 legal issues",
      "content_md": "Hah,\n\nSome of the terms I have used for laser optics shipments to/from various countries.\n\nItems with these descriptions travel quickly and without fuss...\n\n- lasers = 'redundant optical source', 'optical equipment', 'pulsed light source'\n\n- ruby rods = 'transparent optical media', 'craft materials', 'optical rods'\n\n- laser mirrors = 'second-hand optics'\n\n- flashlamps = 'replacement bulbs', 'linear electronic bulbs', 'spare lamps'\n\nDoug.",
